- **Rites of Flourishing** (2G) - Let EVERYONE draw extra and play extra lands!\n\
- **Scaretiller** (4) - 1/4 that ramps when it attacks/blocks!\n\
- **Arcane Signet** (2) - More mana fixing!\n\
- **Abundance** (2GG) - Dig for lands or spells!\n\
\n\
**THE CHAMPION'S STRATEGIC DILEMMA:**\n\
We have 4 untapped lands now. We can:\n\
1. Play a land (Myriad Landscape) + Kodama's Reach (5 mana total next turn)\n\
2. Play Arcane Signet + land + still have 2 mana up\n\
3. Play Rites of Flourishing - helps the whole table but WE benefit most!\n\
\n\
