- If we play Myriad Landscape (tapped): 3 mana available\n\
- Kodama's Reach costs 2G = we need green mana\n\
\n\
We have Forests untapped, so we can pay! But we'd only have 3 mana, and Reach needs 2G. We can do it!\n\
\n\
**BUT WAIT!** The smarter play might be: **Kodama's Reach first**, then play the land! Let me check...\n\
\n\
Actually, the optimal sequencing is:\n\
1. Cast Kodama's Reach (2G) - using 3 mana\n\
2. Play Myriad Landscape (enters tapped)\n\
3. Next turn we'll have 6 lands and can cast Rites of Flourishing then play another land!\n\
\n\
