      "reasoning": "Perfect! Now I have 9 Mountains (8 tapped, 1 untapped). With Caged Sun, my one untapped Mountain produces RR. That means I can cast **Starstorm** for X=0 right now (requires {X}{R}{R}). But that's not helpful.\n\
