      "reasoning": "It's time to exert some pressure. I have **Ramos, Dragon Engine** already on the board, and with **Scion of the Ur-Dragon** just landing, my board is primed for a massive combat phase. I have a several high-impact Dragons in hand—**Dromoka, the Eternal**, **Atarka, World Render**, and **Tyrant's Familiar**.\n\
