    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Kimi25 ESPN is choosing targets for Sylvan Reclamation (exile up to two artifacts/enchantments). Fist of Suns is a reasonable target as it enables cheating out expensive dragons, but the second target selection matters too. Kindred Discovery on Sarge's board (drawing cards for each dragon ETB/attack) or Rites of Flourishing (which benefits all opponents equally but also benefits Kimi25 ESPN themselves) could be considered. However, Rites of Flourishing is Kimi25 ESPN's OWN enchantment - exiling it would be self-destructive. The real question is whether Fist of Suns is the best first pick versus something like Kindred Discovery or Herald's Horn, which are actively generating value for KimiK2 Sarge. Gem3F Spike is at 23 life and already behind, while KimiK2 Sarge at 43 life with Kindred Discovery is the bigger threat. Targeting Kindred Discovery (massive card advantage engine for the leading player) would likely have been higher impact than Fist of Suns (which requires WUBRG and Gem3F Spike only has 6 lands, some tapped).",
